. And Sarah Vaughan had pipes that - you know, please God. But they all went in a different way. They would go with the music. They knew more about music than I did. I don't know squat about music. I don't know anything about it. I don't read it. I can't play it. I just have ears. They were more musicians. And Carmen was a musician, Sarah. They were jazz singers, to me. Then, as I say, I sa...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16448$40AD10BA-157D-43F0-A21A-064044691309", "rank": "normal"}]}}